# The calibration ship-gate decision artifacts (calibration_ship_gate.md/.json)
# ARE intentionally force-tracked for audit — they are the go/no-go record of
# record. Raw *.jsonl run outputs stay ignored; the confusion counts that back
# the belief math already live in tracked src/indra_belief/calibration_constants.py.
